        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 72000ECB, Solid Brass Patio Door Trim Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe timeless square shape of Omnia's 72000 series multipoint trim allows it to be easily transformed from a classic look to a modern one by selecting different levers; and with so many to choose from, you'll be sure to find just the right one to match your style. These solid brass leversets are for use with European Cylinder Below Lever (european profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. Available in 4 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Thru-Bolts</b> are fixed at 8-1/2\" center to center and can not be modified. In some cases new thru-bolting holes must be drilled in your door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced. The multipoint trim set is intended to replace the original trim from Hoppe, Hurd, JELD-WEN, Kolbe & Kolbe, Lincoln, Loewen, Peachtree, Norco, Semco, Vetter, Weathershield, Therma-Tru, Willmar, Sierra Pacific, KFV, Simpson, Signature, Crestline, Windsor and others. The <b>Lock to Lever</b> distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74528-SM.jpg?v=1704354547\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"72000ECB Multipoint Trim Sets dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Square Patio Trim <a href=\"/products/square-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-72000acb\">with <b>American Cylinder Below</b> the lever</a> and <a href=\"/products/square-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-72000aca\">with <b>American Cylinder Above</b> the lever</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia 72000ECB Multipoint Trim Sets\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass Trim</li>\r\n<li>Lock to Lever Spacing: 3-5/8\" (92 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Thru-Bolt Hole Spacing: 8-1/2\"  (216 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 9-13/16\" (250 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/2\" (12.5 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square European Cylinder Patio Door Trim Set",
                "description": "Omnia 72000ECB European Cylinder Below - The timeless square shape of Omnia's 72000 series multipoint trim allows it to be easily transformed from a classic look to a modern one by selecting different levers; and with so many to choose from, you'll be sure to find just the right one to match your style. These solid brass leversets are for use with European Cylinder Below Lever (european profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. Available in 4 finishes.",
